    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Us on Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Breakout: Infinite is an immersive tactical extraction FPS. Join the fight to shoot and loot your path to fortune. With realistic visuals and true-to-life audio, push through tough battles where the stakes are high and the rewards even higher.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE KAMONA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into five unique maps with multiple game modes designed for every kind of player. Want a low-risk run? Secure Ops lets you raid without losing your gear. Flying solo? Test your skills and instincts in Solo Ops. Prefer the heat of combat? Go all-out in Team Elimination or Deathmatch. Or take on the challenge of brutal weather in the Storm Warning mode. For the ultimate challenge, the Forbidden Zone is where the end-game high stake PvP is at. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/2f174587ba576c065fdf982d42875909.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/2f174587ba576c065fdf982d42875909.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TACTICAL EXTRACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success isn't just about pulling the trigger\u2014it's about making the right call at the right time. Bring the right gear. Choose your route. Decide whether to engage or evade. In the Dark Zone, every decision matters. The goal is simple: extract alive and take home the loot. Just remember\u2014everyone else is playing for keeps too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e2b060d0082e929acfa9979416a66ce2.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e2b060d0082e929acfa9979416a66ce2.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSIVE WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where every detail matters. Powered by real-time lighting and full 360\u00b0 spatial audio, every raid feels like you're really there. Choose your loadout and play your way\u2014go in heavy or stay fast and stealthy. Every raid is a fresh chance to survive, adapt, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/5bb59a7fc3f780e5ef40a3aa604a7b6d.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/5bb59a7fc3f780e5ef40a3aa604a7b6d.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEXT-LEVEL GUNSMITHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream weapon with the deepest customization system out there. With over 900 mods across 20+ attachment slots, every gun is yours to perfect. Designed with real firearm mechanics in mind, it's the most authentic gunsmith experience you'll find in any shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.webm?t=1754360754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.mp4?t=1754360754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOCKED, LOADED, AND PLAYER-FOCUSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Breakout: Infinite delivers top-tier quality-of-life features. From fast gear setups and quick-heal systems to killcams and constant content updates, every element is built to keep you in the fight and fully immersed. No fluff\u2014just fast, fierce, and fluid gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/125cffe45ad5ff1e289fdf1294f40650.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/125cffe45ad5ff1e289fdf1294f40650.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Breakout: Infinite is an immersive tactical extraction FPS. Join the fight to shoot and loot your path to fortune. With realistic visuals and true-to-life audio, push through tough battles where the stakes are high and the rewards even higher.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE KAMONA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into five unique maps with multiple game modes designed for every kind of player. Want a low-risk run? Secure Ops lets you raid without losing your gear. Flying solo? Test your skills and instincts in Solo Ops. Prefer the heat of combat? Go all-out in Team Elimination or Deathmatch. Or take on the challenge of brutal weather in the Storm Warning mode. For the ultimate challenge, the Forbidden Zone is where the end-game high stake PvP is at. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/2f174587ba576c065fdf982d42875909.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/2f174587ba576c065fdf982d42875909.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TACTICAL EXTRACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success isn't just about pulling the trigger\u2014it's about making the right call at the right time. Bring the right gear. Choose your route. Decide whether to engage or evade. In the Dark Zone, every decision matters. The goal is simple: extract alive and take home the loot. Just remember\u2014everyone else is playing for keeps too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e2b060d0082e929acfa9979416a66ce2.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/e2b060d0082e929acfa9979416a66ce2.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSIVE WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where every detail matters. Powered by real-time lighting and full 360\u00b0 spatial audio, every raid feels like you're really there. Choose your loadout and play your way\u2014go in heavy or stay fast and stealthy. Every raid is a fresh chance to survive, adapt, and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/5bb59a7fc3f780e5ef40a3aa604a7b6d.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/5bb59a7fc3f780e5ef40a3aa604a7b6d.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEXT-LEVEL GUNSMITHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream weapon with the deepest customization system out there. With over 900 mods across 20+ attachment slots, every gun is yours to perfect. Designed with real firearm mechanics in mind, it's the most authentic gunsmith experience you'll find in any shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.webm?t=1754360754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/7be34d54d888dede220846a1bac21773.mp4?t=1754360754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOCKED, LOADED, AND PLAYER-FOCUSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena Breakout: Infinite delivers top-tier quality-of-life features. From fast gear setups and quick-heal systems to killcams and constant content updates, every element is built to keep you in the fight and fully immersed. No fluff\u2014just fast, fierce, and fluid gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/125cffe45ad5ff1e289fdf1294f40650.poster.avif?t=1754360754\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/125cffe45ad5ff1e289fdf1294f40650.webp?t=1754360754\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
